  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 2902.06 “Allowance” means “allowance” as defined in RSA 125-O:2, II, reprinted in Appendix B, except that for purposes of this chapter, the term does not include mercury or carbon dioxide (CO2) .\n\nSource. #10002, eff 10-1-11 (from Env-A 2903.06); ss by #12995, eff 2-25-20",
